[{"id": 37831244, "text": "Prepositions can be used to describe when, where and why something happened. In this activity, you will practise using all three.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": "Asset 57-PelWSvuzSaMGkQgqFY8t1.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 37831161, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 37831553, "text": "<h2>What to Do:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Player 1 asks four questions for player 2 to answer. These questions begin with:\n<ul style=\"list-style-position: inside\">\n<li><span style=\"color:#1E90FF\">what</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#1E90FF\">when</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#1E90FF\">where</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#1E90FF\">why</span></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li>Player 2 answers the first question with a <span style=\"color:#228B22\">verb</span> and the other three using whole sentences that include <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">prepositions</span>. </li>\n</ul>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 37831161, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 45166055, "text": "Example Prepositions Game", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 45165974, "text": "In this example, the question words are in <span style=\"color:#1E90FF\">blue</span>, the verb is in <span style=\"color:#228B22\">green</span> and the prepositions are in <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">orange</span>:\n<br></br>\n<ol>\n<li>Player 1 asks: “<span style=\"color:#1E90FF\">What</span> did you do today?”</li>\n<li>Player 2 answers with a verb, e.g. “I <span style=\"color:#228B22\">ran</span>.”</li>\n<li>Player 1 asks: “<span style=\"color:#1E90FF\">When</span> did you <span style=\"color:#228B22\">run</span>?”</li>\n<li>Player 2 answers, e.g. “I <span style=\"color:#228B22\">ran</span> <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">at</span> playtime,” or “I <span style=\"color:#228B22\">ran</span> <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">in</span> the morning.”</li>\n<li>Player 1 asks: “<span style=\"color:#1E90FF\">Where</span> did you <span style=\"color:#228B22\">run</span>?”</li>\n<li>Player 2 answers, e.g. “I <span style=\"color:#228B22\">ran</span> <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">around</span> the playground,” or “I <span style=\"color:#228B22\">ran</span> <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">down</span> the corridor.”</li>\n<li>Player 1 asks: “<span style=\"color:#1E90FF\">Why</span> did you <span style=\"color:#228B22\">run</span>?”</li>\n<li>Player 2 answers, e.g. “I <span style=\"color:#228B22\">ran</span> <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">because of</span> the lion chasing me,” or “I <span style=\"color:#228B22\">ran</span> <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">due to</span> the rain.”</li>\n<li>Swap over so that Player 2 can ask the questions.</li>\n</ol>\n<br></br>\n<b>Note:</b> \n<br>In step 8, if you choose ‘because’ it’s really important to say ‘because of’ not just ‘because’. This is so that you are using a preposition – if you leave out ‘of’, ‘because’ might be working as a conjunction instead.\n", "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 129, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 129, "name": "Example Prepositions Game", "logCreatedAt": "2021-12-06T13:34:07.269289", "logUpdatedAt": "2021-12-06T13:34:07.269289", "logCreatedById": null, "logUpdatedById": null, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 37831161, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 129, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null